{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いていただき、\nありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "埼玉県出身のえんどうりこです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「久しぶりだね〜」って言い合えて、\nツアーの思い出を話せて、\nみんなの近況も聞くことができて、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しい二日間だったよ〜♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15枚目シングルミート&グリート、\nありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「最近は何してたのー？」\nって思わず聞きたくなっちゃうくらい、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会っていない間のみんなのことも気になっていたんだな〜、と\nお話ししながら気づきました。☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こうして久しぶりに会って、\n近況を聞いたり、\nたわいもない話をすることができて、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とっても嬉しかったです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また次に会える日が楽しみ〜！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobbC8EpY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobpJv6hc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "同じポーズばっかりになっちゃうから、\n1枚目の写真はあいりにポーズを決めてもらったよ。☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobyPJGpU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほら、\nまた似たようなポーズ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そういえばみんなピンクの服好きー？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ピンクを着ている日はいつにも増して褒めてもらえるような、、、🤔"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobdA2kaQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この髪型メンバーが褒めてくれた〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少し大人っぽいふわふわしたローポニー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobR3Cg5w.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぷにーっ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また同じポーズだ。\nって思った？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うん、自分でも思った、、🤫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobaW6UnD.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "誰の背中に寄りかかってるでしょ〜☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "答えはね、\n思わずちょっかいをかけてしまうけど、\nいっぱい笑ってくれる人ー！😳"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『愛MUST BE』\nミュージックビデオが公開されました！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/Sp4xl7wtqtc"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ドレスで踊っている姿が\nカッコよくて綺麗で、、、。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "周りに沢山の愛を分けてくれる子がこの楽曲のセンターですごく嬉しいです💃"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きっとこれからいろんな方に愛される楽曲になるんだろうな〜。💭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは、今日のブログはここまで！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただき、\nありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう一回MV見てきまーす🫡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね☺︎"}], "source": "official"}